<view class="beauty-page">
  <view class="beauty-cover">
    <view class="beauty-cover-top"><view class="cover-number"><text>01</text></view><text class="cover-series">A GENTLE FACE STUDY</text><view class="cover-top-rule"></view><text class="cover-wordmark">TOOLBOX</text></view>
    <view class="beauty-cover-copy"><text class="beauty-overline">一场轻轻的观察</text><text class="beauty-title">颜值分析</text><view class="beauty-lead"><text>给镜头里的自己，</text><text>一份温和的参考。</text></view><text class="beauty-cover-note">轻松体验 · 仅供娱乐</text></view>
    <image class="beauty-cover-art" src="../../assets/illustrations/tool-beauty.png" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="beauty-cover-flower">✳</view>
  </view>

  <view class="beauty-content">
    <view class="beauty-section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">A SMALL, FRIENDLY CHECK</text><text class="beauty-section-title">这次会看到什么</text></view><text class="beauty-section-index">01 — 03</text></view>
    <view class="beauty-feature-card">
      <view class="beauty-feature-row"><text class="beauty-feature-no">01</text><view class="beauty-feature-copy"><text class="beauty-feature-title">面部特征</text><text class="beauty-feature-desc">观察照片中的年龄感、性别与脸型特征。</text></view><text class="beauty-feature-mark">↗</text></view>
      <view class="beauty-feature-rule"></view>
      <view class="beauty-feature-row"><text class="beauty-feature-no">02</text><view class="beauty-feature-copy"><text class="beauty-feature-title">颜值参考分</text><text class="beauty-feature-desc">0~100 分的娱乐向参考，附拍摄小建议。</text></view><text class="beauty-feature-mark">↗</text></view>
      <view class="beauty-feature-rule"></view>
      <view class="beauty-feature-row"><text class="beauty-feature-no">03</text><view class="beauty-feature-copy"><text class="beauty-feature-title">气质小注</text><text class="beauty-feature-desc">按分数段生成风格评语与拍摄建议。</text></view><text class="beauty-feature-mark">↗</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="beauty-privacy-card" bindtap="onTogglePrivacy">
      <view class="privacy-card-head"><view class="privacy-seal">✓</view><view class="privacy-card-title-group"><text class="privacy-card-kicker">A PROMISE, BEFORE YOU BEGIN</text><text class="privacy-card-title">先说明照片会去哪里</text></view><text class="privacy-toggle">{{privacyExpanded ? '收起 −' : '了解 + '}}</text></view>
      <view class="privacy-quick-note"><text class="privacy-quick-strong">照片不会保存，分析后立即删除。</text><text class="privacy-quick-sub">仅用于本次分析 · 不提取人脸特征</text></view>
      <block wx:if="{{privacyExpanded}}"><view class="privacy-expanded">
        <text class="privacy-line">· 照片仅用于本次分析，分析完成或失败后立即从云端删除，不写入数据库，不做长期存储。</text>
        <text class="privacy-line">· 不提取、不保存任何人脸生物特征，不建立用户画像。</text>
        <text class="privacy-line">· 照片将传输至腾讯云人脸识别接口完成当次分析，仅此用途。</text>
        <text class="privacy-line">· 不调用微信人脸核身等身份认证接口。</text>
      </view></block>
      <view class="privacy-card-footer"><text class="privacy-link" catchtap="onOpenAgreement">查看《隐私政策》全文</text><text class="privacy-link-arrow" catchtap="onOpenAgreement">↗</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="beauty-cta-wrap"><view class="beauty-cta" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onStart"><text class="beauty-cta-top">准备好了，就从一张照片开始</text><view class="beauty-cta-bottom"><text class="beauty-cta-title">开始分析</text><view class="beauty-cta-arrow">↗</view></view></view></view>
    <view class="beauty-disclaimer"><text class="disclaimer-mark">i</text><text class="beauty-disclaimer-text">本工具结果由算法估算，仅供娱乐参考，不构成对任何人外貌的任何评价。请勿上传他人照片。</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
